OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FThe parents of four people killed in
OL,7,Fshootings in the same year, including
OL,8,Fnine-year-old Olivia Pratt Korbel,
OL,9,Fhave united in the hope of preventing
OL,10,Fyoung people turning to a life of
OL,11,Fcrime.
OL,13,FCheryl Korbel, who was injured when
OL,14,Fshots were fired into her home,
OL,15,Fkilling her daughter, on 22 August
OL,16,F2022, joined other bereaved relatives
OL,17,Fto launch a new police education
OL,18,Finitiative, four years on from the
OL,19,Fspate of shootings.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
