FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FShe said: "Hopefully, it makes a big
OL,7,Fdifference and people think twice
OL,8,Fbefore even picking a weapon up."
OL,10,FIn the same week that Olivia died, 28-
OL,11,Fyear-old Ashley Dale was killed in her
OL,12,Fhome in Old Swan, Liverpool, and Sam
OL,13,FRimmer, 22, was was killed in Dingle.
OL,15,FOn Christmas Eve that year, beautician
OL,16,FElle Edwards, 26, was murdered when a
OL,17,Fgunman fired shots into a group of
OL,18,Fpeople outside the Lighthouse pub in
OL,19,FWirral, Merseyside.
OL,26,@nD@KOUpD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FThe parents of the four victims
OL,7,Fgathered at Olivia's Tree ` the
OL,8,Fmemorial in Dovecot close to where the
OL,9,Fschoolgirl lived ` to launch the Dear
OL,10,FMerseyside initiative, which has been
OL,11,Fnamed after a poem by Joseph Roberts.
OL,13,FAs the anniversary of Olivia's death
OL,14,Fapproached, Ms Korbel said she had to
OL,15,F"take every day as it comes, one step
OL,16,Fin front of the other".
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FShe added: "Olivia should have turned
OL,7,F13 on 13 June 2026. She would be in
OL,8,Fhigh school with her friends, sharing
OL,9,Fthe excitement of becoming a teenager.
OL,10,FInstead, we are left holding the
OL,11,Fmilestones she never got to reach."
OL,13,FJulie Dale, the mother of 28-year-old
OL,14,Fenvironmental health worker Ms Dale,
OL,15,Fsaid: "Obviously August is a difficult
OL,16,Ftime for us, but I just think every
OL,17,Fday is difficult."
OL,26,@nD@LOUsD@cO]wD@GOUyD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
