OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FShe said the families, who were
OL,7,Fstrangers before the tragedies, had
OL,8,Fprovided support for each other over
OL,9,Fthe last four years."We get it, we get
OL,10,Fwhat each other are going through,"
OL,11,Fshe said.
OL,13,F"We help each other loads."People can
OL,14,Fsay, 'Oh, we know how you're feeling'.
OL,15,FNot until your child's been murdered.
OL,16,FNo-one knows how you're feeling."
OL,26,@qD@UOUrD@cO]uD@AOUuD@[OUxD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
