FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FIn the wake of the murders, Merseyside
OL,7,FPolice was given funding by the Home
OL,8,FOffice to begin a Clear, Hold, Build
OL,9,Foperation, known locally as EVOLVE,
OL,10,Fbringing together police, local
OL,11,Fauthorities and other agencies to
OL,12,Ftackle serious organised crime and
OL,13,Fcreate safer neighbourhoods.
OL,15,FIn September, the scheme will launch
OL,16,Fthe Dear Merseyside resource in
OL,17,Fschools and youth organisations, using
OL,18,Fthe families' stories to try and
OL,19,Fencourage young people to think
OL,20,Fdifferently about violence,
OL,21,Fexploitation and the choices they make.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FIn a statement, the families said: "We
OL,7,Fhave chosen to support this resource
OL,8,Fbecause we want young people to hear
OL,9,Fthe human stories behind the headlines.
OL,11,F"We hope they see that every act of
OL,12,Fviolence leaves families, friends and
OL,13,Fcommunities living with its
OL,14,Fconsequences forever.
OL,16,F"If this helps even one young person
OL,17,Fto think differently, make a better
OL,18,Fchoice or stay safe, it matters."
OL,26,@nD@dOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
