OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786970910
OL,3,CParents of shooting victims unite to
OL,4,Csteer youth away from crime
OL,6,FDetective Chief Superintendent Paul
OL,7,FGrounds, the head of EVOLVE for
OL,8,FMerseyside Police, said: "We are
OL,9,Fincredibly grateful to the families
OL,10,Ffor helping create a lasting legacy
OL,11,Ffrom unimaginable loss.
OL,13,F"We hope this resource inspires young
OL,14,Fpeople across Merseyside to make
OL,15,Fpositive choices, support one another
OL,16,Fand help build safer, stronger
OL,17,Fcommunities for generations to come."
OL,26,@pD@ZOUuD@AOUyD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/8
